aptfs (0.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Implement 'close' syscall. The lack of this functionality was causing
    the aptfs process to eventually exhaust its file descriptors.
  * Implement 'write' syscall.
  * Remove .pyc files in debian/rules 'clean' target

